/-- **Universal Oddness and Mod-4 First-Step Divergence in the Dense Core
(`dense_core_all_V_odd_and_mod_four_divergence`)**:
In the Dense Core $j(r) \in \{1, 2\}$ with $V(0) \ge 1$ and
$2^{3 j(r + 1) + 4} V(r + 1) + 1 = 3^{3 j(r) + 4} V(r)$:
