1. **Exact Prefix-Collision Biconditional for All Horizons $K \in \mathbb{N}$**:
   For every $r_1 < r_2$ and $K \in \mathbb{N}$, with
   $E_K = \text{defectStepSum}(\text{fun } t \Rightarrow j(r_1 + 1 + t),\, K)$:
   $$(\forall t \le K,\; j(r_1 + t) = j(r_2 + t))
