   - **Unconditional Exact Full-Power `3`-Adic Remainder (100% independent of `U_1, W_3, m_1, L_3`):**
     `(2^(10*L_2 + 7*L_3) * W_3) % 3^(10*L_2 + 7*m_1) = 19 * R_{L_2}`.
