/-- **The Universal Multi-Wave Constant of Motion (`W(0) - 1` and `U(0)`) & Full-Power `3`-Adic Remainder Laws for All Horizons `N ≥ 0`:**
Across any `N + 1` consecutive waves (`N ∈ ℕ`), `2059 * Acc_N < 3^(S_N)` and `58025 * Acc̃_N < 3^(S̃_N)`
