/-!
## Section 71: Multi-Wave `+19`-Cancellation Homogeneous Difference Laws & the Global All-Horizon Two-Sided Wave Corridor (`3^(10*L_2(0)) * W(0) < 2^(10*L_2(N+1)) * W(N+1)`)

