   from the initial-interface homogeneous difference law proves **unconditionally for ALL horizons `N ∈ ℕ`**:
     `3^(10*L_2(0)) * W(0) < 2^(10*L_2(N+1)) * W(N+1)`  and
     `58025 ∣ (2^(10*L_2(N+1)) * W(N+1) - 3^(10*L_2(0)) * W(0))`!
