/-!
## Section 80: The Full-Exponent Archimedean Wave Bound (`2 * 3^(S_N + 10*L_2(0) - 1) * W(0) < 2^(S_N + 10*L_2(N+1)) * W(N+1)`) & the Cumulative Step-Sum Run-Expansion Law (`p' * S_N + 10*(p'+q')*L_2(0) < 10*q'*L_2(N+1) + p'`)

