/-- **The Full-Exponent Archimedean Wave Bound & the Cumulative Step-Sum Run-Expansion Law:**
For every horizon `N ∈ ℕ`, `2 * 3^(S_N + 10*L_2(0) - 1) * W(0) < 2^(S_N + 10*L_2(N+1)) * W(N+1)`;
