/-!
## Section 81: Unconditional Multi-Wave Growth in `{1, 2}` (`631 * W(0) < W(N+1)` for All `N ≥ 1` with `L_2(N+1) ≤ 2`, and `W(0) < W(1)` Whenever `2 ≤ L_1(0)`)

